    ### Setting up the connection
    
    1. **Create an Intercom app**: Visit the [Intercom Developer Hub](https://app.intercom.com/a/developer-signup), create a new App, then copy the Access Token. 
    2. **Open Realm:** Go to `https://<your-domain>.withrealm.com/admin/connect?open=intercom` 
