# Admin features ⛑️

- **What admin features are available in Realm?**
    
    Realm admins can access the following features under “Admin” in Realm’s main menu.
    
    - Users – invite and manage your organization’s Realm users.
    - Connectors – manage the knowledge that is connected to Realm.
    - Models – control the LLMs available to your organization’s users.
    - Usage data – access granular analytics on your organization’s usage of Realm
    - API Access Tokens – create and manage your API access keys.